@ 0 1 0 01eaeca5798d1a3b02d48ba44beec41c
+         detail
+             ```tabular

@ 0 11 0 101866bec2f5bb1a1577630c18dc96dc
+             column  Cas
+             column  Code
+             column  Message
+             column  Remarque
+             row  `OutOfRange(value, minimum, maximum)`  1  _the value `value` is outside the range `minimum` to `maximum`_  une facette de borne, ou la borne implicite d'un type entier
+             row  `LengthOutOfRange(value, minimum, maximum)`  2  _the length of `value` is outside the range `minimum` to `maximum`_
+             row  `PatternMismatch(value, pattern)`  3  _the value `value` does not match the pattern `pattern`_
+             row  `NotPermitted(value, permitted)`  4  _the value `value` is not one of `permitted`_  une facette d'énumération
+             row  `TooManyDigits(value, total, fraction)`  5  _the value `value` has more digits than the `total` total or `fraction` fraction digits permitted_
+             row  `Absent(name)`  6  _the element or attribute `name` is required_  un élément ou un attribut requis
+             row  `Malformed(value, expected)`  7  _the text `value` is not a valid `expected`_, or _the value has no text to read as `expected`_  une valeur que son type ne peut pas lire ; `value` vaut `Unset` pour un élément sans texte

@ 0 1 0 1325124b3afc2ca70063c3f620bd5dcc
+             ```

